@startuml
participant A
participant B
participant "Gamma G" as G
note over A : single over
note over A, B : spanning two
note over A,G : spanning three
note left of A : left note
note right of B : right note\nwith a break
note right of G : rightmost
note left of G : left of the last
A -> B : msg
note over B
  multi-line
  note body & <escapes>
end note
note left of A
first
second
endnote
hnote over A : hexagon form
rnote over B : rect form
NOTE OVER A : uppercase keyword
note over A
end note
note right of "Gamma G" : quoted target
note over A, "Gamma G"
  two lines\nplus a break
end	note
@enduml
